WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Academic Writer. From a rough idea to a footnoted article you can defend.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
You bring the topic, the sources and the thesis.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
It maps the evidence in your sources: arguments, quotations, page numbers.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
It drafts in your voice, and checks every footnote against the page.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
You get a Word file. Comment on it like any draft; it folds your comments back in.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Free and open source. Hebrew and English.
